    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lonely Space is an old-school sci-fi immersive sim game. You find yourself awakened from hibernation in the docking bay of the Cassiopeia Space Station. Your crew is missing and the station overrun by mutated personnel and an insane security system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/781c88c4a50f84211b34602dc0d6b524.poster.avif?t=1745526899\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/781c88c4a50f84211b34602dc0d6b524.webm?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/781c88c4a50f84211b34602dc0d6b524.mp4?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your unique playstyle: brute force, stealth, hacking, psionics, and more\u2014 freely combining approaches to experiment and tackle challenges your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/c5930b131abb13d6e1a10a4c52ee826c.avif?t=1745526899\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various decks, each with unique elements and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash light sources to cloak yourself in darkness and evade enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use parkour and various suit modules to access hidden areas and evade enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the station's security systems. They are not on your side!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use UV lamps to uncover hidden messages and unravel the station\u2019s dark secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/be2a466199f30c5ee35811ce83059bd7.poster.avif?t=1745526899\" width=600 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/be2a466199f30c5ee35811ce83059bd7.webm?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/be2a466199f30c5ee35811ce83059bd7.mp4?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/a96026d9c5a06874746f914d45e2706a.avif?t=1745526899\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast arsenal of firearms, melee, and energy weapons. And even organic ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load firearms with varied ammo types: standard, incendiary, corrosive, and shock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy weapons offer multiple firing modes tailored to any situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your weapon with upgrade kits found throughout the station or bought from vending machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/78e5bc1f2267618a6c870525175d997e.poster.avif?t=1745526899\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/78e5bc1f2267618a6c870525175d997e.webm?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/78e5bc1f2267618a6c870525175d997e.mp4?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/bef3741ff6cb7d5d62ba7e9480c3d6bc.avif?t=1745526899\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover neuro-blueprints to unlock psionic abilities, installing them directly into your brain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wield combat abilities to set fire traps, trigger acid explosions, or electrocute foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Harness mind powers to see through walls, slow time, or turn invisible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master control powers to pull and push objects and enemies, as well as create protective barriers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/d37f10e5306aea33e467956c3a03d21a.poster.avif?t=1745526899\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/d37f10e5306aea33e467956c3a03d21a.webm?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/d37f10e5306aea33e467956c3a03d21a.mp4?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/e53bbe371158946ec8613f6a419da5b0.avif?t=1745526899\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every challenge has multiple solutions \u2014 improvise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and throw lab rats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of ammo? Hurl severed limbs and lab equipment as weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A severed head is also a great weapon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lonely Space is an old-school sci-fi immersive sim game. You find yourself awakened from hibernation in the docking bay of the Cassiopeia Space Station. Your crew is missing and the station overrun by mutated personnel and an insane security system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/781c88c4a50f84211b34602dc0d6b524.poster.avif?t=1745526899\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/781c88c4a50f84211b34602dc0d6b524.webm?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/781c88c4a50f84211b34602dc0d6b524.mp4?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your unique playstyle: brute force, stealth, hacking, psionics, and more\u2014 freely combining approaches to experiment and tackle challenges your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/c5930b131abb13d6e1a10a4c52ee826c.avif?t=1745526899\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various decks, each with unique elements and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash light sources to cloak yourself in darkness and evade enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use parkour and various suit modules to access hidden areas and evade enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the station's security systems. They are not on your side!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use UV lamps to uncover hidden messages and unravel the station\u2019s dark secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/be2a466199f30c5ee35811ce83059bd7.poster.avif?t=1745526899\" width=600 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/be2a466199f30c5ee35811ce83059bd7.webm?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/be2a466199f30c5ee35811ce83059bd7.mp4?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/a96026d9c5a06874746f914d45e2706a.avif?t=1745526899\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast arsenal of firearms, melee, and energy weapons. And even organic ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load firearms with varied ammo types: standard, incendiary, corrosive, and shock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy weapons offer multiple firing modes tailored to any situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your weapon with upgrade kits found throughout the station or bought from vending machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/78e5bc1f2267618a6c870525175d997e.poster.avif?t=1745526899\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/78e5bc1f2267618a6c870525175d997e.webm?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/78e5bc1f2267618a6c870525175d997e.mp4?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/bef3741ff6cb7d5d62ba7e9480c3d6bc.avif?t=1745526899\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover neuro-blueprints to unlock psionic abilities, installing them directly into your brain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wield combat abilities to set fire traps, trigger acid explosions, or electrocute foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Harness mind powers to see through walls, slow time, or turn invisible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master control powers to pull and push objects and enemies, as well as create protective barriers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/d37f10e5306aea33e467956c3a03d21a.poster.avif?t=1745526899\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/d37f10e5306aea33e467956c3a03d21a.webm?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/d37f10e5306aea33e467956c3a03d21a.mp4?t=1745526899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2664120/extras/e53bbe371158946ec8613f6a419da5b0.avif?t=1745526899\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every challenge has multiple solutions \u2014 improvise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and throw lab rats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of ammo? Hurl severed limbs and lab equipment as weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A severed head is also a great weapon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
